{"id":"bc3a966a4af2f1ea","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-np-ntm.md","title":"NP via Nondeterministic Turing Machines","display":"df-np-ntm — NP via Nondeterministic Turing Machines","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ntime]]"],"display":"df-np-ntm — NP via Nondeterministic Turing Machines","label":"28-df-np-ntm","aliases":["28-df-np-ntm"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-np-ntm — NP via Nondeterministic Turing Machines"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-np-ntm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-np-ntm</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a> 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下文引入语言类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+2)^a\">\\((n+2)^a\\)</span> 统一处理空串与短输入；在容许常数因子的复杂度约定下与通常的多项式并类一致。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.6；印刷41–42页；PDF67–68页。对应并类陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)$ 是 [[28-df-ntime]] 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；$a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).","display":true},{"tex":"(n+2)^a","display":false}],"bytes":877,"backlinks":[{"id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{NTM}}$ (NTM 刻画的 NP 类, see [[28-df-np-ntm]])"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"验证器刻画：[[28-df-np-ntm]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]、[[28-thm-np-verifier-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["7514d356710d2e51"]}